{"id":"ved_","lemma":"ведь","pos":"intj","rank":112,"glosses":["after all","indeed, surely","why, well"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b4/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это ведь не очень далеко?","en":"That's not very far, is it?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"far off"}]},{"text":"Вам ведь известно её имя?","en":"You know her name, don't you?","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},null,{"g":"it is known"},{"g":"her"},{"g":"personal name"}]},{"text":"Это ведь была твоя идея?","en":"This was your idea, wasn't it?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},{"g":"idea, thought, notion"}]},{"text":"Не вы ведь хозяин.","en":"It's not like you're the owner.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"owner, proprietor"}]},{"text":"А ведь я пытался тебя предупредить.","en":"I did try to warn you.","words":[{"g":"and / but"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to attempt, to try","l":"пытаться"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"to warn"}]}]}